(6808037, 1023656, 137320, '<td valign="top">Scored this much higher than similar pics in this challenge. To me the difference maker is the immediate feeling you get from this. Deconstructing it, I like how left side of the frame is light and the right side is dark. It almost looks like a yin-yang symbol. Putting the dark stones on the lighter side and using a stack of lighter stones to put on the dark part of the reflection would have been really cool (to run with that idea). 8 from me, def one of my favorites.</td>', 'Scored this much higher than similar pics in this challenge. To me the difference maker is the immediate feeling you get from this. Deconstructing it, I like how left side of the frame is light and the right side is dark. It almost looks like a yin-yang symbol. Putting the dark stones on the lighter side and using a stack of lighter stones to put on the dark part of the reflection would have been really cool (to run with that idea). 8 from me, def one of my favorites.', '2012-07-03 21:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6808038, 1023874, 137320, '<td valign="top">Love this. Very creative, technically good as well. Should get a ribbon for sure.</td>', 'Love this. Very creative, technically good as well. Should get a ribbon for sure.', '2012-07-03 21:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
