(6809118, 1023735, 23394, '<td valign="top">this strikes me as the polar opposite of zen.  frenetic, urban, non-soothing.  abstract to the point of challenging my imagination as opposed to relaxing me.  don''t get me wrong - i love the image - but personally feel that it doesn''t come close to meeting the challenge.</td>', 'this strikes me as the polar opposite of zen.  frenetic, urban, non-soothing.  abstract to the point of challenging my imagination as opposed to relaxing me.  don''t get me wrong - i love the image - but personally feel that it doesn''t come close to meeting the challenge.', '2012-07-04 21:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6809129, 1023954, 23394, '<td valign="top">too contrasty for me.  i''m looking for something relaxing and here i''m more worried about what could be in the shadows.</td>', 'too contrasty for me.  i''m looking for something relaxing and here i''m more worried about what could be in the shadows.', '2012-07-04 21:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6809131, 1023006, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice and peaceful.  don''t mind the overall softness, but the blown highlights are a little harsh.</td>', 'nice and peaceful.  don''t mind the overall softness, but the blown highlights are a little harsh.', '2012-07-04 21:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6809138, 1023888, 23394, '<td valign="top">this just doesn''t do much for me, aesthetically or technically.  the focus is off, i don''t like the reflections on the vessels, and it''s a little too contrasty.  also, the overall tone is not that inviting or soothing.</td>', 'this just doesn''t do much for me, aesthetically or technically.  the focus is off, i don''t like the reflections on the vessels, and it''s a little too contrasty.  also, the overall tone is not that inviting or soothing.', '2012-07-04 21:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6809139, 1023882, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like the image, but not for this challenge.  it has more of a hint of violence than an air of peace and absolution.  it puts me more on edge than calms me down.</td>', 'i like the image, but not for this challenge.  it has more of a hint of violence than an air of peace and absolution.  it puts me more on edge than calms me down.', '2012-07-04 21:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
