(6813760, 1023386, 66267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by miamimanq7:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this really a 5 minute exposure? What time was it taken? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i can''t remember exactly what time it was taken at, but there was still some light in the sky. wasn''t full blown daylight, but it wasn''t dark. i bought an 8-stop nd variable filter specifically for this challenge because i knew what i wanted to shoot. unfortunately, 8-stops isn''t enough for long exposures in full daylight. i had to use the max setting on the filter for this 5 minute one and it was already getting dark.</td>', 'Originally posted by miamimanq7: Is this really a 5 minute exposure? What time was it taken?   i can''t remember exactly what time it was taken at, but there was still some light in the sky. wasn''t full blown daylight, but it wasn''t dark. i bought an 8-stop nd variable filter specifically for this challenge because i knew what i wanted to shoot. unfortunately, 8-stops isn''t enough for long exposures in full daylight. i had to use the max setting on the filter for this 5 minute one and it was already getting dark.', '2012-07-09 16:32:22.000000', NULL, 0),
